@startuml
    title Student Work Placement Coordination Service - Domain Model
    left to right direction
    hide methods
    hide circle
    skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

    class Student {
      studentNumber
      name
      location
    }

    class Programme {
      programmeCode
      title
      programmeOutcomes
      evidenceRequirements
    }

    class Opportunity {
      title
      status
      startDate
      endDate
      duties
      provisionalDetails
      employerRequirements
      location
      capacity
    }

    class Employer {
      organisationName
      contactName
    }

    class Agreement {
      agreedDate
      terms
    }

    class Request {
      submittedDate
      priorityRuleApplied
      preferences
      interests
      evidence
      status
      waitingOn
    }

    class Staff {
      staffNumber
      name
      role
    }

    class Decision {
      decisionType
      outcome
      decisionDate
      basis
    }

    class Conflict {
      conflictType
      description
      identifiedDate
      status
    }

    class OperationalChange {
      changeDate
      description
      reason
    }

    class Placement {
      allocationDate
      startDate
      endDate
      status
      statusReason
      supervisor
    }

    class Action {
      description
      dueDate
      status
      statusReason
      statusChangedDate
    }

    class Review {
      reviewDate
      newInformation
      outcome
    }

    Student "0..*" -- "1" Programme : is enrolled on
    Student "1" -- "0..*" Request : submits

    Opportunity "0..*" -- "1" Employer : is offered by
    Opportunity "1" -- "0..*" Request : receives

    Employer "0..1" -- "0..*" Decision : makes

    Agreement "0..1" -- "1" Placement : governs

    Request "1" -- "0..1" Placement : results in
    Request "0..1" -- "0..*" Action : requires

    Staff "0..1" -- "0..*" Decision : records
    Staff "1" -- "0..*" Action : is responsible for

    Decision "0..*" -- "1" Placement : concerns
    Decision "0..1" -- "0..1" Decision : supersedes

    Conflict "0..*" -- "1..*" Placement : involves

    OperationalChange "0..*" -- "1" Placement : applies to

    Action "0..*" -- "0..1" Placement : belongs to
    Action "0..*" -- "0..1" Review : is generated by

    Review "0..*" -- "1" Placement : reviews
    Review "0..1" -- "0..*" OperationalChange : leads to

    Placement "0..*" -- "0..*" Placement : is linked to

    note as N1
      <u>Constraints</u>

      <b>BR01</b> A Request cannot reach status "ready for decision"
      without the evidence its Programme requires.

      <b>BR04</b> A Placement cannot move to confirmed unless every
      important requirement is satisfied (provisional ones may
      exist while information is missing - P3S5).

      <b>BR05</b> A Placement cannot proceed without both an employer
      selection Decision and an academic approval Decision.

      <b>Decision makers<b>
      A selection decision is made by an Employer,
      an academic approval is recorded by Staff. Whether staff may also
      record a selection on an employer's behalf is open (US06 Q3).

      <b>Action owner</b>
      Each Action belongs to exactly one Request
      or one Placement, never both and never neither.

      <b>BR06 / NFR04</b> Earlier Decisions are superseded, never overwritten.

      <b>BR07</b> An OperationalChange or status change is never a Decision.

      <b>FR09</b> Provisional Placements and Opportunities are not
      counted as confirmed capacity.
    end note
@enduml